silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_02_membership_arrow_yoneda_hom_legs silm:hasExample "In 'MembershipArrowYonedaHomLegs', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, a residency probe (e.g. the vet care plan asking \"is Mittens a household resident?\") factors through the member_of arrow into the dwelling apex; the probe is monic on its evidence image." .
